<title>RUSSIA: Indian PM to visit Russia, meet Yeltsin.</title>
<headline>Indian PM to visit Russia, meet Yeltsin.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Prime Minister H.D. Deve Gowda is due in Moscow on March 24 on a three-day visit which includes meetings with President Boris Yeltsin and Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin, the Kremlin said on Tuesday.</p>
